{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encavermen: Near you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Genre and Style</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person action-adventure game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative approach inspired by Plato\u2019s Allegory of the Cave.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a real event that occurred in San Fernando, Chile, in 1968.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/extras/6f964aa3752c272437b2e0bac717558f.avif?t=1760159016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/extras_big/6f964aa3752c272437b2e0bac717558f.avif?t=1760159016 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Intense and Atmospheric Plot</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of an oil plant worker following a mysterious explosion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission: sabotage the explosion\u2019s core to prevent a greater catastrophe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative blending reality and fiction in an apocalyptic setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Exploration and Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic levels: from destroyed streets to critical industrial zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect tools and blueprints to unlock new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with heavy machinery and electrical systems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/extras/549910869cf896b955e7d067dcc0d725.poster.avif?t=1760159016\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/extras/549910869cf896b955e7d067dcc0d725.webm?t=1760159016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/extras/549910869cf896b955e7d067dcc0d725.mp4?t=1760159016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Challenges and Puzzles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental hazards and deadly traps caused by the explosion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technical puzzles such as restoring power or repairing vital circuits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty as the environment deteriorates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Sound Design</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense and ambient soundtrack that enhances immersion and suspense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative pacing that heightens urgency and danger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/extras/48c8ffbe6b01e13ad863ad09523776c2.poster.avif?t=1760159016\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/extras/48c8ffbe6b01e13ad863ad09523776c2.webm?t=1760159016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/extras/48c8ffbe6b01e13ad863ad09523776c2.mp4?t=1760159016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Philosophical Themes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reflection on the perception of reality and confronting fear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Allegory of the Cave as the conceptual backbone of the protagonist\u2019s journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015050?t=1760159016","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/45a7e8e5332eccc94b9feca9b9db5a87af587fc2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760159016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/fd564d41f9423fe6e3b8368cb2c5d6c9a747fa67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760159016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015050/fd564d41f9423fe6e3b8368cb2c5d6c9a747fa67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760159016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encavermen: Near you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Genre and Style</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person action-adventure game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative approach inspired by Plato\u2019s Allegory of the Cave.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a real event that occurred in San Fernando, Chile, in 1968.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=